# Copy to frontend/.env.local if you need to override defaults. Everything here is PUBLIC:
# Vite embeds VITE_* values in the browser bundle, so never put passwords or secrets here.

# Leave empty to call the API at /api on the same origin (Vite dev proxy locally,
# vercel.json rewrite in production). Only set it if the frontend calls the API cross-site,
# e.g. VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com/api (requires COOKIE_SAMESITE=none on the backend).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Path or URL of the downloadable resume. Replace the PDF in public/resume/ to update it.
VITE_RESUME_URL=/resume/Rakesh_Godumala_Resume.pdf
